  "new_commit_message": "[skills] eas-app-stores: scope signing and submission to verified releases (#224)\n\nBuild and submit the requested app using verified build IDs and\ndestinations. Keep account-owner credential setup private, and summarize\nselected build/submission fields instead of displaying raw status\noutput. Include validated failure codes and canonical Expo documentation\nlinks when available; keep free-text errors and private URLs hidden.\nCorrect the Android submission profile example.\n\nA test ZIP based on an earlier head of this PR, packaged as `expo2`\nversion 1.15.4 with npm CLI references pinned, passed the ChatGPT plugin\nsubmission scan on November 17, 2026 (author-reported). The repository\nmanifests remain at 1.15.5; the source skill commands still use\n`@latest`.\n\n## Test plan\n\n- `bun test scripts` — 42 passed on this top branch, including 22\nrelease status summary tests.\n- `bun scripts/check-skill-limits.ts`, `bun\nscripts/check-overview-routing.ts`, and `bun\nscripts/check-plugin-version-bump.ts origin/main` — passed.\n- `git diff --check origin/main...HEAD` — passed.\n- GitHub `check` workflow must complete successfully on this head\ncommit.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Kudo Chien <kudo@KudodeMacBook-Pro.local>",
